==Battleground==
*6 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Star Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If you have obtained any of the [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], this stage becomes easy enough for you to continue spamming random fodder units in. Remember to bring [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] as none of your fodder units will probably have enough damage to break Le'Solar's Barrier.

